{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your friend is playing \u300aYour Cock\u300b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a desktop pet software that allows you to have a lively little chicken walking freely on your desktop. You can interact with it by clicking (not available in demo version) or simply let it roam around your screen as shown in the video!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No story, no goals, and no rules! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's just adorable, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Instructions ]<br>When hovering over the desktop pet:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll wheel - Zoom in/out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold left click - Drag to move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click - Show exit button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963950/extras/8ca318102f34e4976ba9a3181e378b1f.poster.avif?t=1772786372\" width=480 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963950/extras/8ca318102f34e4976ba9a3181e378b1f.webm?t=1772786372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963950/extras/8ca318102f34e4976ba9a3181e378b1f.mp4?t=1772786372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963950?t=1772786372","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963950/78e2ebf453e9e680b1944615cede9cb928d76